    "estimatedSeconds": 600,
    "stem": "A boat leaves a harbour $H$ on Lake Kariba and sails 18 km on a bearing of $060^\\circ$ to an island $I$. It then sails 11 km on a bearing of $150^\\circ$ to a fishing camp $F$.",
    "parts": [
      {
        "label": "(a)",
        "type": "NUMERICAL",
        "marks": 1,
        "stem": "Show that angle $HIF = 90^\\circ$ by finding the bearing of $H$ from $I$. Enter the bearing of $H$ from $I$.",
