          "unitHint": "°"
        },
        "answerSpec": {
          "value": 240
        },
        "explanation": "The bearing of $H$ from $I$ is $060^\\circ + 180^\\circ = 240^\\circ$. Angle $HIF = 240^\\circ - 150^\\circ = 90^\\circ$."
      },
      {
        "label": "(b)",
        "type": "NUMERICAL",
        "marks": 2,
        "stem": "Calculate the distance $HF$, correct to 3 significant figures.",
        "payload": {
          "unitHint": "km"
        },
        "answerSpec": {
          "value": 21.1,
          "tolerance": {
            "kind": "absolute",
            "amount": 0.05
          },
          "units": {
            "required": false,
            "accepted": [
              "km",
              "kilometres",
              "kilometers",
              "kilometre"
            ]
          }
        },
        "explanation": "$HF = \\sqrt{18^2 + 11^2} = \\sqrt{445} = 21.09\\ldots \\approx 21.1$ km."
      },
      {
        "label": "(c)",
        "type": "NUMERICAL",
        "marks": 2,
        "stem": "Calculate angle $IHF$, correct to 1 decimal place.",
        "payload": {
          "unitHint": "°"
